1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:08,866
Speaking, task one. Topic 5: My town. Ten questions. Listen to the question and answer aloud.

2
00:00:09,567 --> 00:00:12,126
Which town do you live in?

3
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:22,763
I live in Kralupy nad Vltavou. It's a small town near Prague.

4
00:00:23,667 --> 00:00:26,714
Is your town big or small?

5
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:36,807
My town is small, it has about eighteen thousand inhabitants.

6
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,573
What is interesting in your town?

7
00:00:45,967 --> 00:00:50,314
The Vltava river and a nice park by the station are interesting.

8
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,108
Where do you like going most in town?

9
00:00:59,500 --> 00:01:03,673
I like going to the park and walking by the river most.

10
00:01:04,567 --> 00:01:07,625
How do you get to work in town?

11
00:01:13,033 --> 00:01:17,915
I go to work by bus, the journey takes fifteen minutes.

12
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:21,243
What is missing in your town?

13
00:01:26,633 --> 00:01:30,168
There's no cinema and not enough playgrounds for children.

14
00:01:31,067 --> 00:01:34,590
What was your town like when you arrived?

15
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:44,800
When I arrived, the town was quiet and I didn't know anyone.

16
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:49,177
What did you do in town last Saturday?

17
00:01:54,567 --> 00:02:00,052
Last Saturday I went to the market on the square and bought vegetables.

18
00:02:00,967 --> 00:02:04,501
Will you live in this town in the future too?

19
00:02:09,900 --> 00:02:15,884
Yes, I think I'll live here in the future too, because I like it here.

20
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:20,776
What would you recommend to a tourist in your town?

21
00:02:26,167 --> 00:02:31,106
I'd recommend a walk along the river and a visit to the church.

22
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:42,733
Great! Practise topic 5 on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website, the link is in the video description. And subscribe — a new video every day.
